at i felt like  at the deadline the previous lifetime  ago  but uh uh he's just like i said  he's uh he's really assimilated into our  group really well and like i said  he's gonna be a guy we're gonna need to  rely on  next question today will come from jesse  granger of the athletic  this one's for max i know you haven't  played any games up here but there have  been a lot of  penalties and and the power play minutes  have been high and as a guy who is a big  key piece to this power play i'm just  wondering how important you think that's  going to be and maybe if you're if  you're excited to get  maybe some extra minutes on the power  play yeah and  hopefully we do get that opportunity but  you still have to work for your power  plays i think we saw a game last night  that didn't show as many  um power plays so maybe you know the  calls will go down less and less as the  series move on um  but the power play is a good way to jump  right in and feel confident get some  puck touches um  you know we've shown that we've been  able to be a very capable power play of  changing games and  i want to come in and you know that's an  area i definitely want to try and help  the boys  next question today come from phil  thompson of the chicago tribune  hello uh this is from max just really  uh briefly it's been a long time uh  since you've  played uh the the hawks uh  do they look like the same team to you  you know  yeah i think no they don't look like the  same team  this is a new season we saw so many  teams get bounced already or  teams you know struggle that didn't  struggle during the year to find their  game right now but  um this is a new team they're they were  had a couple young guys obviously we  know who they are that  um you know from year one year two or  you know  every uh you know off season you have an  opportunity to improve especially as a  young player and i think they've had  guys that were able to take that time  and take their game to a new level so  um 